    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d10">

                <pb facs="0066" n="8" sameAs="frus:frus1866p3/pg8"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Campbell to Mr. Seward</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Office</hi> U. S. <hi
                                rendition="#small-caps">Military Telegraph, War
                            Department.</hi></placeName></seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[From <placeName>New York</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1866-11-09">November 9,
                        1866</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Hon. W. H. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Seward, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary
                            of State</hi>:</hi></p>
                <p>Arrived with General Sherman last evening; have received instructions sent here
                    by mail, and by Plumb. I find in them no instructions as to how I am to proceed
                    to Mexico, nor any orders placing any vessel at my disposal.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>LEWIS D. CAMPBELL, <hi rendition="#italic">Metropolitan
                        Hotel.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
